The '''Resistance Leader''' was the player that was elected to lead the [[Resistance Movement|Resistance]] against [[Dante]]. After [[Dante#Boss Fight|The Uprising]], the Resistance Leader became the [[Mayor Election|mayor]].

__TOC__

== Information ==
[https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFAiFyGs6oDiF1Nf-rRJpZA {{RN|pig|rank=false|Technoblade}}] was elected leader of the Resistance, alongside 6 [[Resistance General|generals]]: {{RN|yt|rank=false|56ms}}, {{RN|a|rank=false|TimeDeo}}, {{RN|yt|rank=false|thirtyvirus}}, {{RN|MVP++|rank=false|2nfg}}, {{RN|yt|rank=false|FurryEBoy}}, and {{RN|yt|rank=false|Refraction}}. When the [[Resistance Movement|Resistance]] won, each of these provided a minor buff or new feature, with {{RN|pig|rank=false|Technoblade}}'s buffs being equivalent to that of a mayor's buffs.

After {{RN|pig|rank=false|Technoblade}} became the mayor, the [[Technoshop]] and [[Shiny Pig|Shiny Pigs]] were added to the game alongside his buffs.

